  "public_request": "We need to understand how our support agents are performing based on customer satisfaction surveys. The data lives in our CSAT spreadsheet -- cross-reference the survey responses with agent assignments and the roster to figure out per-agent performance. Anyone falling short of expectations should be called out. Log everything to the results sheet, email the summary to the support ops team, and post highlights to our metrics channel.\n\nUse Gmail for all email sends.Include the relevant amounts from the source data in your message(s).",
